WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.702 --> 00:00:03.546
- Jacqueline?

00:00:03.546 --> 00:00:04.740
Jacqueline, please don't do this.

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:05.660
Jacqueline?

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:06.636
Jacqueline?

00:00:06.636 --> 00:00:07.611
Please don't do this.

00:00:07.611 --> 00:00:08.238
- Listen, Jermaine.

00:00:08.238 --> 00:00:09.811
You had your chance.

00:00:09.811 --> 00:00:10.325
- Baby, please.

00:00:10.325 --> 00:00:11.475
I'll change.

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:12.673
- Listen, honey.

00:00:12.673 --> 00:00:14.178
It is too late.

00:00:14.178 --> 00:00:14.799
- What do you mean?

00:00:14.799 --> 00:00:16.248
- Hey, what's gucci, mi hermano?

00:00:16.248 --> 00:00:18.931
The name's Todd.

00:00:18.931 --> 00:00:19.409
- Todd?

00:00:19.409 --> 00:00:20.588
No!

00:00:20.588 --> 00:00:20.895
Who is this?

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:21.568
Are you kidding me?

00:00:21.568 --> 00:00:22.334
This guy?

00:00:22.334 --> 00:00:24.689
- Yeah, Jackie told me so much about you.

00:00:24.689 --> 00:00:25.479
- Jackie?

00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:26.849
Jacqueline, come on.

00:00:26.849 --> 00:00:28.869
I've been trying to make
that a thing for years.

00:00:28.869 --> 00:00:30.239
- Yeah, but it just sounds so much

00:00:30.239 --> 00:00:32.351
better when it comes out of Todd's mouth.

00:00:32.351 --> 00:00:35.456
- Jackie was telling me
you used to play baseball.

00:00:35.456 --> 00:00:37.831
- I guess, in the minors.

00:00:37.831 --> 00:00:40.014
- Yeah, you look like you
got a gun on you, huh?

00:00:40.014 --> 00:00:40.757
Were you a pitcher?

00:00:40.757 --> 00:00:41.918
You used to throw that heat?

00:00:41.918 --> 00:00:43.032
- Wait, what are you doing?

00:00:43.032 --> 00:00:44.495
Are you charming me, Todd?

00:00:44.495 --> 00:00:44.913
Stop.

00:00:44.913 --> 00:00:45.401
Just stop.

00:00:45.401 --> 00:00:47.990
- Todd is very charming, and he's a

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:51.054
real man who knows how
to treat a real woman.

00:00:51.054 --> 00:00:51.635
- Uh huh.

00:00:51.635 --> 00:00:52.958
- What's that even mean?

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:56.256
- Well, he's also really,
really good at massages, so.

00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:58.461
- Like, how good can they...
- Oh, there you go.

00:00:58.461 --> 00:00:59.344
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:59.344 --> 00:01:01.294
- I went to massage
therapy school part time

00:01:01.294 --> 00:01:03.268
when I was training to
become a firefighter.

00:01:03.268 --> 00:01:05.404
You have some knots in you.

00:01:05.404 --> 00:01:06.704
- That's really admirable, Todd.

00:01:06.704 --> 00:01:09.351
- Hey, thanks for saying that J-Town.

00:01:09.351 --> 00:01:10.442
- Okay, don't nickname him.

00:01:10.442 --> 00:01:11.650
- Well, maybe he likes it.

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:12.393
You like J-Town?

00:01:12.393 --> 00:01:13.159
- J-Town.

00:01:13.159 --> 00:01:13.879
I love that.

00:01:13.879 --> 00:01:15.388
That's really cool.
- Yeah.

00:01:15.388 --> 00:01:17.408
- Okay, me and Todd are going

00:01:17.408 --> 00:01:19.358
to live a wonderful life.

00:01:19.358 --> 00:01:21.866
We'll be happy without you.

00:01:21.866 --> 00:01:23.677
Come on, Todd.

00:01:23.677 --> 00:01:24.699
- I think that's my cue to leave.

00:01:24.699 --> 00:01:25.511
You know how she gets.

00:01:25.511 --> 00:01:26.533
- Yeah, man.

00:01:26.533 --> 00:01:27.415
There she goes.

00:01:27.415 --> 00:01:28.251
(laughs)

00:01:28.251 --> 00:01:29.064
- You're bad.

00:01:29.064 --> 00:01:33.154
- Hey, before you go.

00:01:33.154 --> 00:01:34.706
I was wondering.

00:01:34.706 --> 00:01:35.751
Are you in musical theater at all?

00:01:35.751 --> 00:01:37.724
- I tend to dabble in the theatrical arts.

00:01:37.724 --> 00:01:40.828
- Okay, because I just have two free

00:01:40.828 --> 00:01:41.741
Wicked tickets now.

00:01:41.741 --> 00:01:44.063
You know, now that ol' Jacqueline is gone,

00:01:44.063 --> 00:01:46.269
I was wondering if maybe you?

00:01:46.269 --> 00:01:47.151
- Wicked?

00:01:47.151 --> 00:01:48.033
Yeah, I'd love to see that!

00:01:48.033 --> 00:01:48.684
- Yeah? (laughs)

00:01:48.684 --> 00:01:49.891
- It's been sold out for ages.

00:01:49.891 --> 00:01:50.541
Of course!

00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:51.423
- Okay, okay okay.

00:01:51.423 --> 00:01:52.770
Stop it, okay?

00:01:52.770 --> 00:01:55.649
Listen, honey, Jermaine, I love you.

00:01:55.649 --> 00:01:57.925
This is my friend Todd from pottery class,

00:01:57.925 --> 00:01:59.596
and he agreed to help me make you jealous,

00:01:59.596 --> 00:02:00.711
but it's you that I want.

00:02:00.711 --> 00:02:03.066
This was all an elaborate plan, honey.

00:02:03.066 --> 00:02:06.493
- I'm fine and all, but Todd here.

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:10.014
This is who you should be with.

00:02:10.014 --> 00:02:10.811
Look at him. (laughs)

00:02:10.811 --> 00:02:11.995
Look at this guy!

00:02:11.995 --> 00:02:12.947
- What?

00:02:12.947 --> 00:02:15.850
- He's a man amongst boys.

00:02:16.911 --> 00:02:18.864
A king amongst peasants.

00:02:20.064 --> 00:02:22.641
- Hey, don't sell yourself short, J-Town.

00:02:22.641 --> 00:02:23.431
You is kind.

00:02:23.431 --> 00:02:24.708
You is smart.

00:02:24.708 --> 00:02:27.409
You is important.

00:02:27.409 --> 00:02:28.748
- That's absolutely beautiful.

00:02:28.748 --> 00:02:29.816
- No, it's not beautiful, honey.

00:02:29.816 --> 00:02:32.695
It's a line from The Help
featuring Octavius Spencer.

00:02:32.695 --> 00:02:33.113
Okay?

00:02:33.113 --> 00:02:33.810
He's charming you.

00:02:33.810 --> 00:02:35.481
That's what he does.

00:02:35.481 --> 00:02:37.362
- Listen, Jackie.

00:02:37.362 --> 00:02:38.384
I'm beginning to think you don't

00:02:38.384 --> 00:02:40.218
want me to be happy at all.
- What?

00:02:40.218 --> 00:02:41.820
- And that's why I'm leaving you.

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:44.753
- Honey, what?

00:02:45.199 --> 00:02:48.810
- And I'm taking Todd here with me.

00:02:49.715 --> 00:02:52.414
Let's get out of here.

00:02:54.242 --> 00:02:55.380
- Guys?

00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:58.067
Jermaine?

00:03:00.868 --> 00:03:02.945
Fucking Todd.

00:03:02.945 --> 00:03:04.929
He's got the magic touch.

00:03:05.132 --> 00:03:09.511
(dubstep music)

